  "title": "Why Does \"The\" Sound Different? 🔤 Fun Facts for Kids",
  "cover_text": "THUH OR THEE?",
  "description": "Why do we say \"thuh dog\" but \"thee apple\"? It all depends on the next sound! Leo asks, big sister Mia explains, in under a minute.\n\nThe CurioKids Club: short, curious answers to kids' big questions. Subscribe: https://www.youtube.com/@CurioKidsClub",
